    rows 0,4 all black; cols 0,4,8 all black
    left region: rows 1-3, cols 1-3 (code glyph)
    right region: rows 1-3, cols 5-7 (mask)
  code_glyph:
    exactly 5 grey pixels forming one of 3 shapes:
      T-shape: "###/.#./.#." -> BLUE(1)
      S-shape: "##./.#./.##" -> RED(2)
