    1. create 5x9 black grid
    2. pick one of 3 code glyphs uniformly; place in rows 1-3, cols 1-3
    3. generate random 3x3 mask with 4-7 grey pixels (reject if all black)
    4. place mask in rows 1-3, cols 5-7
    5. output = 3x3 mask with grey replaced by codebook color, black stays black
